# FlowTrace logs
flowtrace.jsonl
flowtrace-*.jsonl
*.jsonl

# ...except the golden fixtures. These are the cross-language behavioural
# contract, not a captured trace. The blanket *.jsonl rule above is the actual
# reason they were never committed despite every golden README calling
# expected.jsonl "the spec" — they were generated and then silently ignored by
# git, so validate-schema had nothing to check and passed anyway.
!examples/golden/*/expected.jsonl

